  "worked_solution": "To compute the acceleration vector, we differentiate the velocity vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\u27e8\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t},\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{3}{t}),\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({5}^{5t})\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e83(-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}),{5}^{5t}\\cdot 5\\operatorname{ln}\u20615\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-\\frac{3}{{t}^{2}},{5}^{5t+1}\\operatorname{ln}\u20615\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
